  "slug": "cynthia-lennon-dies",
  "title": "Cynthia Lennon dies",
  "date": "2015-04-01",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/cynthia-lennon/\">Cynthia Lennon</a>, the first wife of <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>, has died at the age of 75. <span id=\"more-19155\"></span></p><p>She met John when they were at art college students in Liverpool in 1958. They married in 1962, after discovering she was pregnant with their son Julian.</p><p>The couple divorced in 1968, after John met <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a>. She remarried three times, and in later years lived with her fourth husband Noel Charles on the Spanish island of Majorca.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2015/04/01/cynthia-lennon-dies/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-19155 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_004/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John and Cynthia Lennon, 1950s\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9615\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_004/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"300,301\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John and Cynthia Lennon, 1950s\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_004.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1940s-1950s-photos/590829_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01-200x151.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Quarrymen on the opening night of the Casbah Coffee Club, Liverpool, 29 August 1959\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01-200x151.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01-580x438.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01.jpg 764w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8793\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1940s-1950s-photos/590829_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"764,577\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Quarrymen on the opening night of the Casbah Coffee Club, Liverpool, 29 August 1959\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/590829_01.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/661106_john-cynthia-lennon_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"125\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/661106_john-cynthia-lennon_01-125x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John and Cynthia Lennon, 6 November 1966\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/661106_john-cynthia-lennon_01-125x200.jpg 125w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/661106_john-cynthia-lennon_01.jpg 260w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 125px) 100vw, 125px\" data-attachment-id=\"14632\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/661106_john-cynthia-lennon_01