non_001.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/82_john-lennon-statue_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDkiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ5IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"149\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/82_john-lennon-statue_01-149x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Cynthia Lennon with statue of John Lennon and sculptor Brett Livingstone-Strong\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/82_john-lennon-statue_01-149x200.jpg 149w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/82_john-lennon-statue_01.jpg 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" data-attachment-id=\"8552\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/82_john-lennon-statue_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/82_john-lennon-statue_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"300,402\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Cynthia Lennon with statue of John Lennon and sculptor Brett Livingstone-Strong\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/82_john-lennon-statue_01.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_001/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNTciIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTU3IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"157\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001-157x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John and Cynthia Lennon\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001-157x200.jpg 157w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001-457x580.jpg 457w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001.jpg 500w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 157px) 100vw, 157px\" data-attachment-id=\"9612\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_001/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"500,635\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John and Cynthia Lennon\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_001.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_002/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTYxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE2MSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"161\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_002-200x161.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John and Cynthia Lennon, 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_002-200x161.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_002.jpg 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9613\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-cynthia-lennon_002/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_002.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"300,242\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John and Cynthia Lennon, 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-cynthia-lennon_002.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cynthia Lennon – In Loving Memory <a href=\"http://t.co/jI4ONUnLo9\">http://t.co/jI4ONUnLo9</a> <a href=\"http://t.co/cwue6VmPUv\">pic.twitter.com/cwue6VmPUv</a></p><p>— Julian Lennon (@JulianLennon) <a href=\"https://x.com/JulianLennon/status/583284399527067648?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2015</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>Cynthia died on 1 April 2015 at her home in Majorca. The news was announced in a statement on Julian Lennon’s website:</p><blockquote><div>Cynthia Lennon passed away today at her home in Mallorca, Spain following a short but brave battle with cancer.<p></p><p>Her son Julian Lennon was at her bedside throughout. The family are thankful for your prayers.</p><p>Please respect their privacy at this difficult time.</p></div></blockquote><p>Julian also posted a tribute on YouTube, featuring still images of the Lennon family:</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_39385\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fsyYqJxf9Qk?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Peace and love to Julian Lennon God bless Cynthia love Ringo and Barbaraxx</p><p>— #RingoStarr (@ringostarrmusic) <a href=\"https://x.com/ringostarrmusic/status/583301100201062400?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2015</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">I am so devastated this morning with the loss of my good friend.<a href=\"http://t.co/iQ4UFRDL0V\">http://t.co/iQ4UFRDL0V</a> <a href=\"http://t.co/AJ8DZzzi4E\">http://t.co/AJ8DZzzi4E</a></p><p>— May Pang (@maypang) <a href=\"https://x.com/maypang/status/583284323706494976?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2015</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Our heartfelt condolences go out to Cynthia Lennon's family at this sad time. Such warm memories of a lovely lady RIP <a href=\"http://t.co/aYA8CpCUTU\">http://t.co/aYA8CpCUTU</a></p><p>— The Cavern Club (@cavernliverpool) <a href=\"https://x.com/cavernliverpool/status/583298551448514560?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2015</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><div class=\"embed-x\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Rest in peace Cynthia Lennon; a remarkable woman and a true friend to the Beatles Story. <a href=\"http://t.co/Q4YeCWFOMs\">pic.twitter.com/Q4YeCWFOMs</a></p><p>— The Beatles Story (@beatlesstory) <a href=\"https://x.com/beatlesstory/status/583292650448642048?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2015</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 15 September 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2019: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2019/04/01/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-tokyo-electron-hall-miyagi-sendai/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Tokyo Electron Hall Miyagi, Sendai</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/04/01/paul-mccartney-live-sportpaleis-antwerp/\">Paul McCartney live: Sportpaleis, Antwerp</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/04/01/album-release-extended-versions-ringo-starr/\">Album release: Extended Versions by Ringo Starr</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/04/01/paul-mccartney-live-oakland-arena-oakland/\">Paul McCartney live: Oakland Arena, Oakland</a></li><li>1990: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1990/04/01/paul-mccartney-live-california-memorial-stadium-berkeley-2/\">Paul McCartney live: California Memorial Stadium, Berkeley</a></li><li>1979: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1979/04/01/recording-love-awake-wings/\">Recording: Love Awake by Wings</a></li><li>1976: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1976/04/01/alf-lennon-dies/\">Alf Lennon dies</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/04/01/john-lennon-yoko-ono-write-declaration-of-nutopia/\">John Lennon and Yoko Ono write the Declaration of Nutopia</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/04/01/recording-mary-had-a-little-lamb-wings-4/\">Recording: Mary Had A Little Lamb by Wings</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/04/01/recording-uncle-albert-admiral-halsey-paul-linda-mccartney-3/\">Recording: Uncle Albert/Admiral Halsey by Paul and Linda McCartney</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/04/01/recording-across-the-universe-the-long-and-winding-road-i-me-mine/\">Recording: Across The Universe, The Long And Winding Road, I Me Mine</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/04/01/john-lennon-yoko-ono-interview-television-today/\">Television: John Lennon and Yoko Ono interviewed on Today</a></li><li>1967: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/04/01/recording-mixing-sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band-reprise/\">Recording, mixing: Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band (Reprise)</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/04/01/john-lennon-buys-timothy-learys-the-psychedelic-experience/\">John Lennon buys Timothy Leary’s The Psychedelic Experience</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/01/brian-epstein-takes-over-saville-theatre-london/\">Brian Epstein takes over the Saville Theatre, London</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/01/filming-help-29/\">Filming: Help!</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/01/john-lennon-reunited-father-alf/\">John Lennon is reunited with his father Alf</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/01/filming-a-hard-days-night-21/\">Filming: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/04/01/radio-side-by-side/\">Radio: Side By Side</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/01/live-casbah-coffee-club-liverpool-34/\">The Beatles live: Casbah Coffee Club, Liverpool</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/04/01/live-top-ten-club-hamburg/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div>",
  "textContent": "Cynthia Lennon, the first wife of John Lennon, has died at the age of 75. She met John when they were at art college students in Liverpool in 1958. They married in 1962, after discovering she was pregnant with their son Julian.The couple divorced in 1968, after John met Yoko Ono. She remarried three times, and in later years lived with her fourth husband Noel Charles on the Spanish island of Majorca.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCynthia Lennon – In Loving Memory http://t.co/jI4ONUnLo9 pic.twitter.com/cwue6VmPUv— Julian Lennon (@JulianLennon) April 1, 2015Cynthia died on 1 April 2015 at her home in Majorca. The news was announced in a statement on Julian Lennon’s website:Cynthia Lennon passed away today at her home in Mallorca, Spain following a short but brave battle with cancer.Her son Julian Lennon was at her bedside throughout. The family are thankful for your prayers.Please respect their privacy at this difficult time.Julian also posted a tribute on YouTube, featuring still images of the Lennon family:Peace and love to Julian Lennon God bless Cynthia love Ringo and Barbaraxx— #RingoStarr (@ringostarrmusic) April 1, 2015I am so devastated this morning with the loss of my good friend.http://t.co/iQ4UFRDL0V http://t.co/AJ8DZzzi4E— May Pang (@maypang) April 1, 2015Our heartfelt condolences go out to Cynthia Lennon's family at this sad time. Such warm memories of a lovely lady RIP http://t.co/aYA8CpCUTU— The Cavern Club (@cavernliverpool) April 1, 2015Rest in peace Cynthia Lennon; a remarkable woman and a true friend to the Beatles Story. pic.twitter.com/Q4YeCWFOMs— The Beatles Story (@beatlesstory) April 1, 2015Page last updated: 15 September 2026Also on this day...2019: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Tokyo Electron Hall Miyagi, Sendai2003: Paul McCartney live: Sportpaleis, Antwerp2003: Album release: Extended Versions by Ringo Starr2002: Paul McCartney live: Oakland Arena, Oakland1990: Paul McCartney live: California Memorial Stadium, Berkeley1979: Recording: Love Awake by Wings1976: Alf Lennon dies1973: John Lennon and Yoko Ono write the Declaration of Nutopia1972: Recording: Mary Had A Little Lamb by Wings1971: Recording: Uncle Albert/Admiral Halsey by Paul and Linda McCartney1970: Recording: Across The Universe, The Long And Winding Road, I Me Mine1969: Television: John Lennon and Yoko Ono interviewed on Today1967: Recording, mixing: Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band (Reprise)1966: John Lennon buys Timothy Leary’s The Psychedelic Experience1965: Brian Epstein takes over the Saville Theatre, London1965: Filming: Help!1964: John Lennon is reunited with his father Alf1964: Filming: A Hard Day’s Night1963: Radio: Side By Side1962: The Beatles live: Casbah Coffee Club, Liverpool1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
